@startuml
title Booking Lifecycle (Fixed)

state "PENDING" as Pending
state "ACCEPTED" as Accepted
state "PROCESSING" as Processing
state "COMPLETED" as Completed
state "CONFIRMED" as Confirmed
state "CANCELLED" as Cancelled
state "DECLINED" as Declined

[*] --> Pending: Customer chấp nhận đơn ứng tuyển

Pending --> Accepted: Worker chấp nhận (acceptBooking)
Pending --> Declined: Worker từ chối (declineBooking)
Pending --> Cancelled: Customer hủy (cancelBooking)

Accepted --> Processing: Worker bắt đầu công việc (startProcessing)
Accepted --> Cancelled: Customer hoặc Worker hủy (cancelBooking)

Processing --> Completed: Worker hoàn thành & nhập giá (markCompleted)

Completed --> Confirmed: Customer xác nhận hoàn thành (confirmCompletion)

Confirmed --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
Declined --> [*]

@enduml